    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 7.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne na má wifa þonne án hæbbe ⁊ þæt beo his beweddode wife, ⁊ beo be þære anre, þa hwile þe heo libbe, se ðe wyle Godes lage giman mid rihte ⁊ wið hellebyrne beorhgan his sawle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he shall have no more wives than one, and that shall be his wedded wife, and he who seeks to observe God's law aright and to save his soul from hell-fire shall remain with the one as long as she lives.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne na má wifa þonne án hæbbe, ⁊ þæt beo his beweddode wife, ⁊ beo be þære anre, þa hwile þe heo libbe (þus scyldon æfre ge), se ðe wyle Godes lage giman mid rihte ⁊ wið hellebyrne beorhgan his sawle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
